{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "MosaicHostMapping",
    "description": "MOSAIC's mapping between the WRF-Chem host arrays and its own column state: SUBROUTINE mapaer_tofrom_host of chem/module_mosaic_driver.F (WRF v4.8.0, :692-2467), the part chem_opt = 170 reaches (aboxtest_map_method = 1, units_convert = 1, rh_method = 1, gases_fixed = 0), in both directions, and the saturation vapour pressure it forms relative humidity with (esat_gchm, module_mosaic_csuesat.F).\n\nINTO MOSAIC (imap = 0). Every quantity is divided by a constant factor: a gas by factgas = 1e6 (ppmv -> mole fraction); an aerosol component by factaer<x> = factaernum 1e6 mw_<x>_aer (ug per kg of air -> mol per mol of air, factaernum = 1000/28.966 mol of air per kg); the number by factaernum (per kg -> per mole of air); the water and hysteresis water by the same factor with mw_water_aer. The cell: cairclm = rho/28.966e3, ptotclm = p/0.1 (Pa -> dyn/cm^2), h2o = qv/0.622, and relhumclm = h2o/max(rsat, 1e-20) held to [0, 0.99] and then to [aboxtest_min_relhum, aboxtest_max_relhum] = [0.05, 0.98], with rsat = esat/(ptot - 0.378 esat). esat_gchm is linear interpolation in a table init_csuesat fills at one-kelvin nodes from 164 to 313 K; it is written here as the same linear blend of the formula evaluated at the two bracketing nodes, which is the table entry by construction. The temperature MOSAIC computes with is then held at or above aboxtest_min_temp = 233 K (FORTRAN_BUGS N126): the relative humidity is formed from the UNCLAMPED temperature, the chemistry runs at the clamped one.\n\nBACK TO THE HOST (imap > 0). The same factors multiply: chem = rsub fact.\n\nWHAT IS NOT HERE. The cloud-water copy rcldwtr_sub (cloud-borne aerosol is off in chem_opt = 170), the box-test branches, and the species chem_opt = 170 does not carry (the SOA and PCG families, glyoxal SOA). The axes are the consumer's: gas is whichever gases it maps (sixteen in chem_opt = 170: so2, h2so4 (sulf), no2, no, o3, hno3, h2o2, hcho, nh3, n2o5, no3, pan, hono, oh, ho2, hcl), comp MOSAIC's ten components.\n\nTESTS. Three steps of the chem170 column (dumps/chem170_wrf esm_dump_mosaic_<s>): the host columns chem_in, t_phy, p_phy, rho_phy and moist_in against MOSAIC's state rsub_in, cairclm, ptotclm and relhumclm after the forward map; and the state after nucleation and coagulation, rsub_coag, against chem_out after the reverse map. WRF does this in real32, so tolerances are rel 1e-6 (measured below).",
    "authors": [
      "EqWeFiC"
    ],
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "wrf-chem",
      "mosaic",
      "aerosol",
      "unit-conversion"
    ]
  },
  "metaparameters": {
    "NLEV": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 59,
      "description": "Grid cells (model levels). The default is the chem_opt = 170 reference column the tests map; a consumer binds its own."
    },
    "NBIN": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 8,
      "description": "MOSAIC size sections (8 in chem_opt = 170)."
    },
    "NCOMP": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 10,
      "description": "Aerosol components per section."
    },
    "NGAS": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 16,
      "description": "Gases mapped (16 in chem_opt = 170)."
    }
  },
  "index_sets": {
    "lev": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": "NLEV"
    },
    "bin": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": "NBIN"
    },
    "comp": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": "NCOMP"
    },
    "gas": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": "NGAS"
    }
  },
  "models": {
    "MosaicHostMapping": {
      "variables": {
        "t_phy": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "K",
          "shape": [
            "lev"
          ],
          "default": 290.0,
          "description": "WRF temperature t_phy."
        },
        "p_phy": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "Pa",
          "shape": [
            "lev"
          ],
          "default": 100000.0,
          "description": "WRF pressure p_phy."
        },
        "rho_phy": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "kg/m^3",
          "shape": [
            "lev"
          ],
          "default": 1.2,
          "description": "WRF air density rho_phy."
        },
        "qv": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "kg/kg",
          "shape": [
            "lev"
          ],
          "default": 0.01,
          "description": "Water vapour mixing ratio moist(p_qv)."
        },
        "chem_gas": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "ppmv",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "gas"
          ],
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "The gases MOSAIC maps (chem(p_sulf), p_hno3, p_hcl, p_nh3, p_n2o5, p_o3, p_so2, ... -- every gas with a p_<x> in the build), ppmv."
        },
        "chem_aer": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "ug/kg",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin",
            "comp"
          ],
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Aerosol component masses chem(lptr_<x>_aer), ug per kg of air."
        },
        "chem_num": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1/kg",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ],
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Aerosol number chem(numptr_aer), particles per kg of air."
        },
        "chem_water": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "ug/kg",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ],
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Aerosol water chem(waterptr_aer)."
        },
        "chem_hysw": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "ug/kg",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ],
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Hysteresis water chem(hyswptr_aer)."
        },
        "mw": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "g/mol",
          "shape": [
            "comp"
          ],
          "default": 1.0,
          "description": "Component molar masses mw_<x>_aer in MOSAIC's component order (so4, no3, cl, co3, nh4, na, ca, oin, oc, bc)."
        },
        "gas_out": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "mol/mol",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "gas"
          ],
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "MOSAIC's gases after its processes, mapped back. (mapaer_tofrom_host with imap > 0)"
        },
        "r_out": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "mol/mol",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin",
            "comp"
          ],
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Component mixing ratios after MOSAIC's processes. (mapaer_tofrom_host with imap > 0)"
        },
        "n_out": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1/mol",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ],
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Number mixing ratio after MOSAIC's processes. (mapaer_tofrom_host with imap > 0)"
        },
        "water_out": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "mol/mol",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ],
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Aerosol water after MOSAIC's processes. (mapaer_tofrom_host with imap > 0)"
        },
        "hysw_out": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "mol/mol",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ],
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Hysteresis water after MOSAIC's processes. (mapaer_tofrom_host with imap > 0)"
        },
        "cair": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "mol/cm^3",
          "shape": [
            "lev"
          ],
          "description": "cairclm = rho_phy/factdens."
        },
        "ptot": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "dyn/cm^2",
          "shape": [
            "lev"
          ],
          "description": "ptotclm = p_phy/factpres."
        },
        "p_atm": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "atm",
          "shape": [
            "lev"
          ],
          "description": "MOSAIC's thermodynamic pressure, ptotclm/1.032e6 (module_mosaic_therm :254; FORTRAN_BUGS N129), the p_atm ASTEM reads."
        },
        "h2o": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "mol/mol",
          "shape": [
            "lev"
          ],
          "description": "rsub(kh2o) = qv/factmoist."
        },
        "es_i": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "shape": [
            "lev"
          ],
          "description": "csuesat's table interval: int(T - tmin) held to [1, nebins]."
        },
        "es_tlo": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "K",
          "shape": [
            "lev"
          ],
          "description": "Temperature of the interval's lower node, tmin + i."
        },
        "es_w": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "shape": [
            "lev"
          ],
          "description": "Linear weight in the interval, held to [0, 1]."
        },
        "esat": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "dyn/cm^2",
          "shape": [
            "lev"
          ],
          "description": "esat_gchm(T): the saturation vapour pressure over water, linear between the one-kelvin nodes of init_csuesat's table."
        },
        "rsat": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "mol/mol",
          "shape": [
            "lev"
          ],
          "description": "Saturation mixing ratio esat/(ptot - (1 - eps) esat)."
        },
        "relhum": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "shape": [
            "lev"
          ],
          "description": "relhumclm: h2o/max(rsat, 1e-20), held to [0, 0.99], then to [min_relhum, max_relhum]. Formed from the temperature BEFORE MOSAIC's 233 K floor."
        },
        "temp": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "K",
          "shape": [
            "lev"
          ],
          "description": "rsub(ktemp): the temperature MOSAIC computes with, held at or above 233 K."
        },
        "gas": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "mol/mol",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "gas"
          ],
          "description": "Gas mole fractions chem/factgas."
        },
        "n": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1/mol",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ],
          "description": "Number mixing ratio chem/factaernum."
        },
        "fact_aer": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "ug/kg",
          "shape": [
            "comp"
          ],
          "description": "factaer<x> = factaernum 1.0e6 mw_<x>_aer: ug of the component per kg of air in one mol of it per mol of air."
        },
        "fact_water": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "ug/kg",
          "description": "factaerwater = factaerhysw = factaernum 1.0e6 mw_water_aer."
        },
        "r": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "mol/mol",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin",
            "comp"
          ],
          "description": "Component mixing ratios chem/factaer<x>."
        },
        "water": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "mol/mol",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ],
          "description": "Aerosol water chem/factaerwater."
        },
        "hysw": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "mol/mol",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ],
          "description": "Hysteresis water chem/factaerhysw."
        },
        "chem_gas_out": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "ppmv",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "gas"
          ],
          "description": "Gases back on the host, gas*factgas."
        },
        "chem_aer_out": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "ug/kg",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin",
            "comp"
          ],
          "description": "Components back on the host, r*factaer<x>."
        },
        "chem_num_out": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1/kg",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ],
          "description": "Number back on the host, n*factaernum."
        },
        "chem_water_out": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "ug/kg",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ],
          "description": "Water back on the host."
        },
        "chem_hysw_out": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "ug/kg",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ],
          "description": "Hysteresis water back on the host."
        }
      },
      "equations": [
        {
          "lhs": "cair",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              "rho_phy",
              "hp.factdens"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "ptot",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              "p_phy",
              "hp.factpres"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "p_atm",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              "ptot",
              "hp.dyncm2_per_atm_therm"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "h2o",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              "qv",
              "hp.eps"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "es_i",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "max",
            "args": [
              1,
              {
                "op": "min",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "floor",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "/",
                        "args": [
                          {
                            "op": "-",
                            "args": [
                              "t_phy",
                              "hp.es_tmin"
                            ]
                          },
                          "hp.one_K"
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  "hp.es_nbins"
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "es_tlo",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "+",
            "args": [
              "hp.es_tmin",
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  "es_i",
                  "hp.one_K"
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "es_w",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "max",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "min",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "/",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "-",
                        "args": [
                          "t_phy",
                          "es_tlo"
                        ]
                      },
                      "hp.one_K"
                    ]
                  },
                  1
                ]
              },
              0
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "esat",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "+",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "apply_expression_template",
                    "args": [],
                    "name": "csuesat_water_node",
                    "bindings": {
                      "t": "es_tlo"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "op": "-",
                    "args": [
                      1,
                      "es_w"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "apply_expression_template",
                    "args": [],
                    "name": "csuesat_water_node",
                    "bindings": {
                      "t": {
                        "op": "+",
                        "args": [
                          "es_tlo",
                          "hp.one_K"
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "es_w"
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "rsat",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              "esat",
              {
                "op": "-",
                "args": [
                  "ptot",
                  {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "-",
                        "args": [
                          1,
                          "hp.eps"
                        ]
                      },
                      "esat"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "relhum",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "min",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "max",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "max",
                    "args": [
                      0,
                      {
                        "op": "min",
                        "args": [
                          "hp.relhum_cap",
                          {
                            "op": "/",
                            "args": [
                              "h2o",
                              {
                                "op": "max",
                                "args": [
                                  "rsat",
                                  "hp.rsat_floor"
                                ]
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  "hp.min_relhum"
                ]
              },
              "hp.max_relhum"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "temp",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "max",
            "args": [
              "t_phy",
              "hp.min_temp"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "gas",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              "chem_gas",
              "hp.factgas"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "n",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              "chem_num",
              "hp.factaernum"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "fact_aer",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              "hp.factaernum",
              "hp.ug_per_g",
              "mw"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "fact_water",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              "hp.factaernum",
              "hp.ug_per_g",
              "hp.mw_water_aer"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "r",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              "chem_aer",
              "fact_aer"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "water",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              "chem_water",
              "fact_water"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "hysw",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              "chem_hysw",
              "fact_water"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "chem_gas_out",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              "gas_out",
              "hp.factgas"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "chem_aer_out",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              "r_out",
              "fact_aer"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "chem_num_out",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              "n_out",
              "hp.factaernum"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "chem_water_out",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              "water_out",
              "fact_water"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "chem_hysw_out",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              "hysw_out",
              "fact_water"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "subsystems": {
        "hp": {
          "ref": "./mosaic_host_parameters.esm"
        }
      },
      "tests": [
        {
          "id": "host_map_s1",
          "description": "The chem_opt = 170 column at model step 1 (dumps/chem170_wrf esm_dump_mosaic_1, WRF fork earthsciml-instrumented-chem170, real32): forward, the host columns entering mosaic_aerchem_driver against MOSAIC's state rsub_in, cairclm, ptotclm and relhumclm (every level; components, number and waters at levels [1, 2, 20, 40, 57, 59]); reverse, the state after nucleation and coagulation rsub_coag against chem_out. 8 levels are colder than 233 K, where MOSAIC's temperature is the floor. The 16 gases: so2, h2so4, no2, no, o3, hno3, h2o2, hcho, nh3, n2o5, no3, pan, hono, oh, ho2, hcl (h2so4 is chem(p_sulf)). WRF maps in real32: rel 1e-6. Filled by tools/fill_mosaic_host_mapping_tests.py.",
